WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.784 --> 00:00:15.164
Tu manges des fruits tous les jours ?
Do you eat fruit every day?

2
00:00:15.264 --> 00:00:18.980
Oui, mais je mange trop de sucre.
Yes, but I eat too much sugar.

3
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.204
Il faut manger moins de gâteaux et boire plus d'eau.
You should eat fewer cakes and drink more water.

4
00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:26.828
Je bois deux litres d'eau par jour.
I drink two litres of water a day.

5
00:00:26.928 --> 00:00:31.628
Très bien ! Et mange plus de légumes.
Very good! And eat more vegetables.

6
00:00:31.728 --> 00:00:35.132
D'accord, je vais essayer !
OK, I'll try!
